OL,3,GNEWSAPolice agree settlement with      
OL,4,Afamily after teen's death              
OL,6,FThe family of a teenager who took his  
OL,7,Fown life after going missing have      
OL,8,Fsettled with Sussex Police after High  
OL,9,FCourt legal action.                    
OL,11,FJason Pulman, 15, was found dead in    
OL,12,FHampden Park, Eastbourne, in April     
OL,13,F2022.                                  
OL,15,FAn inquest into his death in 2024 found
OL,16,Fpolice "responded inadequately" to his 
OL,17,Fdisappearance. Jason's parents say they
OL,18,Ftold police he was transgender, had a  
OL,19,Fhistory of self harm and attempted     
OL,20,Fsuicide, and opportunities to find him 
OL,21,Fwere missed.                           
