OL,3,GNEWSAPolice agree settlement with      
OL,4,Afamily after teen's death              
OL,6,FSussex Police has apologised for its   
OL,7,Fresponse to Jason's disappearance and  
OL,8,Fsaid the force had made changes to its 
OL,9,Fmissing persons policy.                
